  {
    "id": "text_street_right",
    "bbox": [
      445,
      120,
      779,
      210
    ],
    "content": "每每到了夏天，我开始抓不住我自己。\n整个人变成一团云，虚无的，\n没有确切的情绪。\n像是漫长的犯困，醒不过来。",
    "treatment": "plain_text",
    "has_backing": false,
    "decorative_lettering": false,
    "edit_requested": false,
    "text_id": "text_street_right",
    "carrier_id": null,
    "reason": "Derived from the independent text object; no second VLM inventory."
  },
  {
    "id": "text_petals",
    "bbox": [
      154,
      1057,
      398,
      1105
    ],
    "content": "出生在夏天前后，\n于是总会赋予这个季节特殊的意义。\n爱热烈，爱浓郁，爱拥有咸湿的生命力。",
    "treatment": "plain_text",
    "has_backing": false,
